Description
General Competition 2026 Op. socio-assistential.

Pro Senectute Ticino and Moesano publishes annual competitions open even in the absence of an actual staff requirement: applications received are evaluated and possibly recalled during the year.

Social-assisted operators General competition valid for the year 2025 Pro Senectute Ticino and Moesano, the largest cantonal organization of services and services for the maintenance of elderly people, for over a hundred years present in a widespread way throughout the territory thanks to an important number of regional offices and structures, opens the following general competition: Social-assistance workers

Shipments
- Together with the Head of the Centre, promote the processes of social participation of our users in order to prevent marginalization and exclusion;
- Maintain and activate personal resources and the autonomy of the person by promoting and managing activities of various nature (medical, physical, cultural, recreational and cognitive).

Requirements
- AFC Operator/Socio-assistance, disability address;
- Sense of responsibility;
- Pleasure and ease in relation to a third age user;
- attitude to the work of inter and multidisciplinary teams;
- Automunito/a and license B.

What we offer
A new challenge, a varied, interesting and stimulating occupation to be carried out in a professional and pleasant working environment within the socio-assistential day centres and therapeutic day centres.

Compulsory application documentation
- Curriculum Vitae updated;
- Letter of presentation;
- Diplomas and certificates (the equivalence certificates are mandatory for foreign securities);
- Work certificates and references.

Further documentation may be requested during the selection process.

Contact
Applications: interested parties are invited to submit their application by e-mail to job@prosenectute.org. Other forms of application shall not be deemed valid.

This competition is also open in the absence of an actual staff requirement. As an annual competition, with the possibility of being recruited during 2026, candidates will not be given a positive or negative answer. Application data will be deleted at the end of the competition.

